"ws-header wst-header-structure wst-unknown wst-header ws-header ws-noexport noprint dynlayout-exempt\"><div class=\"wst-header-mainblock wst-unknown-mainblock headertemplate\"><div class=\"wst-header-back searchaux wst-unknown-back\"><div class=\"wst-header-back-arrow\">←</div><div class=\"wst-header-back-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-5\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-5\">J-5</a></div></div><div class=\"wst-header-central-cell wst-unknown-central-cell\"><span class=\"wst-header-title wst-unknown-title\"><span class=\"wst-header-title-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a></span><div class=\"header-section-text\">J-6</div></span></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward searchaux wst-unknown-forward\"><div class=\"wst-header-forward-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-7\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-7\">J-7</a></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward-arrow\">→</div></div></div><div class=\"ws-noexport\" id=\"ws-data\" style=\"speak:none\"><span id=\"ws-article-id\">5009323</span><span id=\"ws-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a> — J-6</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\" lang=\"en\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15621227/mw-parser-output/.prp-pages-output\">.mw-parser-output .prp-pages-output .__pagefooter{font-size:smaller}</style><span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"88\" data-page-number=\"88\" data-page-name=\"Page:Consider the Consequences! (IA consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/93\" data-page-index=\"93\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Consider&#95;the&#95;Consequences!&#95;(IA&#95;consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/93\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;93\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15620827\">.mw-parser-output .wst-center{text-align:center;margin:0 auto}.mw-parser-output .wst-center.wst-center-nomargin>p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"wst-center tiInherit\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:120%;\">J-6</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wst-dhr\" style=\"visibility:hidden; line-height:100%;\">&#160;</div>\n<p><span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">Jed's</span> natural tendency was toward women of force of character, and his next love-affair, a year after he had decided not to marry Carol, was with Helen Rogers, a handsome blond girl whose grave beauty was more restful to him than Carol's vivacious prettiness. Mrs.&#160;Harringdale opposed this marriage because although Helen came of a respected family, she had neither the money nor social prominence of Carol, and Mrs.&#160;Harringdale still hoped Jed would renew his inexplicably broken engagement. At one time Jed wanted Helen to elope with him, but she insisted that their marriage must be open and aboveboard.\n</p><p>The two years that followed were distressing to everybody. Mrs.&#160;Harringdale would not recognize her son's engagement to Helen, except by fulminating against it. She developed high blood-pressure under the strain, and the doctors warned Jed that any undue excitement would bring on a stroke and possibly be fatal to his mother. At the end of two years Helen insisted that they must separate or marry. If he was to hold her, Jed had to choose between his mother's health and marriage with Helen.&#32;<span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"89\" data-page-number=\"89\" data-page-name=\"Page:Consider the Consequences! (IA consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/94\" data-page-index=\"94\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Consider&#95;the&#95;Consequences!&#95;(IA&#95;consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/94\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;94\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span>He felt deeply the truth of the old saying that a man may have many sweethearts but he has only one mother.\n</p><p>The reader who decides that he is to marry Helen turns to paragraphs <a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-13\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-13\">J-13</a>. The reader who decides that he is to stand by his mother turns to paragraphs <a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-14\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-14\">J-14</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"&#95;&#95;nop wst-nop\"></div>\n<p>&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77f8cc8f9b‐6hhdh\nCached time: 20260920184845\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐page‐id, vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 185/1000000\nRevision size: 268/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 5740/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1017/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5016/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.024/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032475/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  119.417      1 -total\n 51.89%   61.967      1 Template:Header\n 17.22%   20.564      1 Page:Consider_the_Consequences!_(IA_consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/94\n 17.21%   20.556      1 Page:Consider_the_Consequences!_(IA_consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/93\n 10.99%   13.126      1 Template:C\n  6.15%    7.349      1 Template:Center/s\n  3.11%    3.712      2 Template:Optional_style\n  1.91%    2.283      2 MediaWiki:Proofreadpage_pagenum_template\n  1.85%    2.211      1 Template:Larger\n  1.49%    1.774      1 Template:Center/e\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID e83d32c7-b523-11f1-b41a-c1f57e283a5f -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwikisource:pcache:5009323:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 2